        "category": "mistranslation",
        "severity": "critical",
        "description": "The target renders the whole phrase as '敌军防御工事进攻失败', which can be read as 'enemy's fortification assault failed', implying the fortifications belong to the enemy. The source 'Провальный штурм укреплений врагами' means 'enemy's failed assault on the fortifications', where the enemy is the attacker and the fortifications belong to the player. This swaps the roles and would mislead the player about who owned the fortifications and who was attacking."
      }
    ],
